        "title": "Agentic offer preview version 1 added",
        "summary": "Adds `AGENTIC_OFFER_PREVIEW_VERSION` and `agenticOfferPreviewSchema` to `common/src/ads/agentic-offer.ts` to support embedding a proposal's card and Accept preview in the agentic offer response. The `agenticOfferRequestSchema` accepts an optional `offerPreviewVersion: 1` to signal client support for this feature, allowing the offer to carry the same data currently fetched via `GET /api/v1/ads/proposal` and `GET /api/v1/ads/proposal/{id}/accept`. This enables a single POST for acceptance without a second read when the preview is valid.",
