        "text": "Freebuff can now send the full details of a sponsored task to the assistant in a single step instead of requiring two separate requests, allowing you to accept an ad-funded coding task without waiting for additional information. This internal improvement to the communication between the ad system and the assistant applies to users who see these sponsored offers, making the acceptance process faster and smoother. No action is needed on your part; the change only takes effect when you encounter a task that supports this new preview format.",
